# UseFeedback AI Automation Agent

An AI-powered user feedback automation agent built with n8n and Google Gemini.

## 🚀 Features

- Receives user feedback
- Uses AI to analyze feedback
- Classifies feedback
- Generates an AI-powered response
- Automates the feedback processing workflow

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- n8n
- Google Gemini
- AI Agents
- APIs
- Workflow Automation

## 🔄 Workflow

User Feedback
     ↓
AI Agent
     ↓
Analyze Feedback
     ↓
Classify Feedback
     ↓
Generate Response
     ↓
Store / Process Result



## 📂 Files

- `usefeedback-ai-agent.json` — exported n8n workflow
- `screenshots/` — workflow screenshots

## ⚙️ Setup

1. Install or access n8n
2. Import `UserFeedBack.json`
3. Configure your own credentials
4. Add your Google Gemini API key
5. Test the workflow

## 🔐 Security

API keys and credentials are not included in this repository.

